The TTP223 runs on 3.3V and its output is 3.3V-level compatible with ESP32 GPIOs — do not power it from 5V when connected directly to ESP32 inputs.

**Code**
```cpp
#define TOUCH_PIN 4

void setup() {
  Serial.begin(115200);
  pinMode(TOUCH_PIN, INPUT);  // TTP223 OUT drives the line actively; no pull-up needed
  Serial.println("TTP223 Capacitive Touch Sensor Ready");
}

void loop() {
