| R1 (Row 1) | D9 |
| R2 (Row 2) | D8 |
| R3 (Row 3) | D7 |
| R4 (Row 4) | D6 |
| C1 (Col 1) | D5 |
| C2 (Col 2) | D4 |
| C3 (Col 3) | D3 |
| C4 (Col 4) | D2 |
| (no separate power pin) | — |

**Wiring Diagram**
```
+------------------+          +-------------------+
|   Arduino Uno    |          |  4x4 Matrix Keypad|
|                  |          |                   |
|  D9 (Row 1) -----+----------+ R1                |
|  D8 (Row 2) -----+----------+ R2                |
|  D7 (Row 3) -----+----------+ R3                |
|  D6 (Row 4) -----+----------+ R4                |
|                  |          |                   |
|  D5 (Col 1) -----+----------+ C1                |
