| IN1 | D7 |
| IN2 | D8 |
| GND | GND |
| +5V (logic) | 5V |
| +12V (motor power) | External 12V supply+ |
| GND (motor power) | External 12V supply- and Arduino GND |
| OUT1 | DC Motor terminal A |
| OUT2 | DC Motor terminal B |

**Wiring Diagram**
```
+----------------+          +------------------+
|   Arduino Uno  |          |     L298N        |
|                |          |                  |
|           D9   |--------->| ENA              |
|           D7   |--------->| IN1              |
|           D8   |--------->| IN2              |
|           5V   |--------->| +5V (logic)      |
|          GND   |--------->| GND              |
|                |          |                  |
|                |          | OUT1 |----+       |
|                |          | OUT2 |----+       |
+----------------+          +-----|----|---------+
