| R1 (Row 1) | Pin 2 |
| R2 (Row 2) | Pin 3 |
| R3 (Row 3) | Pin 4 |
| R4 (Row 4) | Pin 5 |
| C1 (Col 1) | Pin 6 |
| C2 (Col 2) | Pin 7 |
| C3 (Col 3) | Pin 8 |
| C4 (Col 4) | Pin 9 |

**Wiring Diagram**
```
+---------------------+          +-------------------+
|      Teensy 4.0     |          |  4x4 Matrix Keypad|
|                     |          |                   |
|  Pin 2 (Row OUT) ---+----------+--- R1             |
|  Pin 3 (Row OUT) ---+----------+--- R2             |
|  Pin 4 (Row OUT) ---+----------+--- R3             |
|  Pin 5 (Row OUT) ---+----------+--- R4             |
|  Pin 6 (Col IN)  ---+----------+--- C1             |
