| VCC | 3.3V |
| GND | GND |
| SCK | GPIO 18 (VSPI SCK) |
| MISO | GPIO 19 (VSPI MISO) |
| MOSI | GPIO 23 (VSPI MOSI) |
| CS | GPIO 5 |

**Wiring Diagram**
```
        +----------------+          +-------------------+
        |   ESP32        |          |  microSD Module   |
        |                |          |                   |
        |    3.3V  ------+----------+-- VCC             |
        |     GND  ------+----------+-- GND             |
        |  GPIO18  ------+----------+-- SCK             |
        |  GPIO19  ------+----------+-- MISO            |
        |  GPIO23  ------+----------+-- MOSI            |
