| Relay Module VCC | 3.3V (or 5V if module requires it) |
| Relay Module GND | GND |
| Relay Module IN (signal) | GPIO26 |
| Relay Module COM | One side of cover motor/actuator |
| Relay Module NO | Power supply positive for cover actuator |

