        |                     |
        |  3.3V |-------------|----+----+
        |   GND |-------------|--+-|--+ |
        |                     |  | |  | |
        | GPIO34|-------------|--(-|--(-+--------+
        |                     |  | |  |          |
        | GPIO26|-------------|--(-|--+    +------+------+
